scope=[
source('internal/domain/client_protocol.go','MODIFY','DecodeEnvelope host.configure branch recognizes exact all-null default scope, or complete session scope. Register a write method with dedicated default path; authenticate local principal and trusted configuration port. Execute performs global principal+command lookup before scoped lookup for all v2 methods, reserve only genuinely new commands inside caller Tx, retains original cancellation ACK finalization. Typed rejection rollback must not orphan identity; original response remains sole authority. Successful configure gets post-response semantic validation before commit. host.status reads current durable owner/principal head/configs, not injected ConfigRevision0.'),
source('internal/domain/client_protocol_configuration.go','NEW','Private domain configuration authority port and handler: authenticated host/principal, metadata-only credential/provider check, stage new immutable configuration and advance host head on EVERY successful configure. Optional settled Session CAS changes model_config_ref and revision exactly once in same original command transaction. No call to qualification, scheduler or MODEL. Typed stable status projection; original rows unmodified.'),
source('internal/domain/client_configuration.go','MODIFY','Explicit amendment to frozen foundation required: factor private typed session-scope path while preserving original default-only helper rejection tests; read validator recognizes exact default or session scope, joins actual project identity rather than hardcoded empty project, verifies original response SessionID/revision/result and canonical full request. Existing three SQL tables/constraints unchanged. History validation never requires current Session ref to equal an older configured ref.'),
source('internal/domain/client_command_identity.go','MODIFY','Explicit narrow amendment: existing unconditional response.SessionID==request.SessionID is incompatible with actual session.create COMPLETED. Accept only that method-specific derived ID when nonempty result.session_id, response SessionID, request project and persisted creation attribution match; reject all other mismatch. Keep goal.start null top-level creation response. Preserve canonical fullhash/global namespace/ambiguous legacy refusal and sole original journal.'),
source('internal/domain/client_protocol_sessions.go','MODIFY','Separate typed configuration visibility + workspace ownership at create/bind from executable runtime admission. An unqualified saved config can create an offline Session; NORMAL/goal execution still requires original admitted runtime. Current authoritative task/run/queue/control/pending permissions checked before rebind, not caller settled flag. No reinterpretation of existing historical Run binding.'),
source('internal/domain/runtime_sessions_windows.go','MODIFY','For configured sessions compare exact typed model_config_ref + provider/model/endpoint/credential-ref against current RuntimeRegistration artifact model_config.ref and private host provider route; zero/ambiguous/mismatched mapping fails closed. Preserve currentRuntimeAdmission at actual send/dispatch, task route identity and frozen dispatch/profile. No auto-created RuntimeRegistration, profile alias or Model.ref substitution.'),
source('internal/domain/runtime_coordinator_windows.go','MODIFY','Only private json:"-" trusted configuration authority injection into existing coordinator config; no new coordinator, polling, scheduler or route selection. Needed to revalidate typed ownership/credential metadata at actual intake using same caller Tx; no database or bridge lock held across network.'),
source('internal/api/server.go','MODIFY','Add explicit trusted composition entry/option for configuration authority while retaining existing public Go wrappers. Actual /v2/command handler and single transaction unchanged. Do not infer trust from caller-supplied HostInstance string or generic workspace interface.'),
source('internal/host/client_configuration.go','NEW','Trusted metadata-only adapter: stable Host.InstanceID(), authenticated boundPrincipal()/verified OS identity, private Vault.record ref/provider/revoked/Kind inspection. No vault.open, CredentialUsable, unprotect, secret return, HTTP, or readiness claim. Credential null remains schema-valid for a supported no-credential route; required credential absence is honest refusal, not arbitrary borrowing.'),
source('apps/control/main.go','MODIFY','Supply same localHost configuration authority in both initial no-runtime handler and final coordinator handler; coordinator receives private authority. Do not change Host.InstanceID algorithm, bootstrap owner, credentials, discovery or source SQL.'),
source('internal/domain/client_protocol_configuration_test.go','NEW','Real SQLite23 + additive tests for handler/CAS/globalidentity/default+session/history/rollback and missing-route offline behavior; includes session.create generated-ID replay and goal.start null creation replay; count all nonzero assertions.'),
source('internal/api/v2_configuration_windows_test.go','NEW','Actual typed HTTP API + isolated real Host/native bootstrap/configure/save zero outbound + backup/restore/rebackup original history test; two clients concurrent config/Session CAS. Uses synthetic credential in temporary fixture only, never user Vault.'),
source('internal/host/client_configuration_windows_test.go','NEW','Trusted metadata identity/provider/revoked/missing/foreign-host tests; assert no decrypt or provider dispatch. Fixed stable instance across restart same directory, different directory not owner adoption.'),
source('internal/domain/runtime_configuration_binding_windows_test.go','NEW','Current coordinator exact stored configuration/admitted profile/route equality; unqualified/ref mismatch/provider/endpoint/credential/foreign owner refuse before effect PREPARED or HTTP. Existing real SDK fixture only when separately authorized; no LIVE qualification in this phase.')]
